|~ The verbs of errors. Each resides on `::qlang/error`, the kind
   every error is a value of: the error `!|` opens is `::error{…}`, or
   the tag of the site that refused stacked over it, and its walk passes
   `::error` on its way to the map, so a verb declared here reaches every
   error. ~|

:trail
  |~~ The path of the error: each step it passed, from the one
      that raised it, with the subject that step met and the steps
      skipped after it.

      ~("x" | add 1 !| trail | count | eq 1)
      ~("x" | add 1 | mul 2 !| trail | first | /skipped | eq ~(mul 2))
  ~~|
  ::verb~(:returns ::vec | /trail)
